  unitName: Lava Beast Vermilion
  unitId: 10774
  unitNumber: 1176
  description: The empress of the rising Agni Empire. Vermilion is known as the heroine
    who continuously invaded other countries in order to expand the reach of her
    empire. Not only are her achievements recorded in Agni's history, but stories
    of her exploits have spread all over the land over centuries, making her a very
    popular character to this day. Though she was the monarch of her nation, Vermilion
    was a powerful warrior mage who always fought in the frontlines alongside a beast
    she had conjured from hot lava, which always accompanied her. The very sight
    of her is said to have struck fear in the hearts of her enemies, but inspired
    unwavering trust from her allies.
  summonDesc: You shall obey me.<br>And if you do, I shall love you.<br>He he...
    What a fool.
  fusionDesc: You seem unhappy.<br>Pledge yourself to me.<br>I promise not to do
    you any harm.
